      "sourceTextSha256": "918faa0b8fe0020acc172ffa7d720bcc558c3b2439e2d19ef8b7f3040ef4cf6d",
      "text": "Day 2 · Breakfast. We head to the Guatemalan highlands, to the town of Chichicastenango, home to one of the most famous indigenous markets in all of Latin America. Today includes an immersive activity: a corn workshop with local women, exploring Guatemala's staple food. After the workshop, we continue toward Lake Atitlán, considered by Aldous Huxley to be the most beautiful lake in the world. Overnight stay.",
